<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom bought back off mkt at NZ$7.12.</title>
<headline>Telecom bought back off mkt at NZ$7.12.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said on Tuesday it bought shares off market on Monday at NZ$7.12 each in the latest round of its buyback programme.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said it bought 105,328 shares.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64-4 473 4746</p>
